<p>Hello there,</p>

<p>The free trial for your Chatwoot account <strong>{{ meta.account_name }}</strong> ends on <strong>{{ meta.trial_ends_on }}</strong>.</p>

{% if meta.has_plan %}
<p>Your <strong>{{ meta.plan_name }}</strong> plan starts that day, and the first payment is charged to the card you added. If you don't want to continue, cancel before then and you won't be charged.</p>

<p><a href="{{ action_url }}">Review your plan or cancel</a></p>
{% else %}
<p>To keep your paid features, choose a plan and add a card before then. You won't be charged until the trial ends. If you don't choose a plan, your account moves to the free {{ meta.free_plan_name }} plan.</p>

<p><a href="{{ action_url }}">Choose a plan</a></p>
{% endif %}

<p>— The Chatwoot Team</p>
